<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?><tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" itunes:timing="Word"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"><ttm:name type="full">Taylor Swift</ttm:name></ttm:agent><iTunesMetadata xmlns="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal"><songwriters></songwriters><translations><translation type="subtitle" xml:lang="zh-Hans"><text for="L1">很高兴遇见你 先前你到哪去了</text><text for="L2">让我来向你呈现不可思议之事</text><text for="L3">魔法 狂热 天堂 罪孽</text><text for="L4">看见你在那 于是我想</text><text for="L5">我的天哪 瞧那漂亮脸蛋</text><text for="L6">我肯定要 栽在你手里了</text><text for="L7">爱情这游戏 想玩吗?</text><text for="L8">新贵公子 西装革履</text><text for="L9">我像读报纸般 读懂你心</text><text for="L10">八卦满天飞 没意思吗</text><text for="L11">我知道你绝对听说过我</text><text for="L12">所以我们做朋友吧</text><text for="L13">我很想看到 这段感情何以终结</text><text for="L14">拿起你的护照 执起我手</text><text for="L15">我一周末就让坏小子 变成乖乖男孩</text><text for="L16">所以一切会走向永恒</text><text for="L17">还是告终于烈火焚尽</text><text for="L18">终场之时 你方可告诉我</text><text for="L19">是否为狂热瞬间 痛苦也值得</text><text for="L20">我有一连串前欢旧爱</text><text for="L21">他们指认我是个疯子</text><text for="L22">因为你知道我就爱花花公子</text><text for="L23">恰好你也痴迷这场爱情游戏</text><text for="L24">正因为我们年轻无畏</text><text for="L25">才会把路走得这么远</text><text for="L26">可结局只会让你喘不过气</text><text for="L27">甚者是留下严重伤疤</text><text for="L28">我有一连串前欢旧爱</text><text for="L29">他们指认我是个疯子</text><text for="L30">但我还预留了个空位 宝贝</text><text for="L31">当然也会写下你的名字</text><text for="L32">樱桃唇瓣 晴朗天空</text><text for="L33">让我来向你呈现不可思议之事</text><text for="L34">偷接的吻 粉饰的谎</text><text for="L35">你来当国王 宝贝 那我就是皇后</text><text for="L36">选择你想成为的类型</text><text for="L37">当那样的女孩一个月</text><text for="L38">等下 最坏的还没来</text><text for="L39">尖叫 哭泣 暴风骤雨</text><text for="L40">我让局势扭转</text><text for="L41">玫瑰园满藏荆棘</text><text for="L42">为此你再三猜忌 问道</text><text for="L43">我的天哪 难道她是这样的?</text><text for="L44">我承认嫉妒之心麻醉了自己</text><text for="L45">但每次你转身离开 终又回到身边</text><text for="L46">亲爱的 怪我本为梦魇 竟乔装成 白日美梦模样</text><text for="L47">所以一切会走向永恒</text><text for="L48">还是告终于烈火焚尽</text><text for="L49">终场之时 你方可告诉我</text><text for="L50">是否为狂热瞬间 痛苦也值得</text><text for="L51">我有一连串前欢旧爱</text><text for="L52">他们指认我是个疯子</text><text for="L53">因为你知道我就爱花花公子</text><text for="L54">恰好你也痴迷这场爱情游戏</text><text for="L55">正因为我们年轻无畏</text><text for="L56">才会把路走得这么远</text><text for="L57">可结局只会让你喘不过气</text><text for="L58">甚者是留下严重伤疤</text><text for="L59">我有一连串前欢旧爱</text><text for="L60">他们指认我是个疯子</text><text for="L61">但我还预留了个空位 宝贝</text><text for="L62">当然也会写下你的名字</text><text for="L63">唯有爱途曲折 才会激发男孩的渴望</text><text for="L64">可别说我没有 说我没有警示过你</text><text for="L65">唯有爱途曲折 才会激发男孩的渴望</text><text for="L66">可别说我没有 说我没有警示过你</text><text for="L67">所以一切会走向永恒</text><text for="L68">还是告终于烈火焚尽</text><text for="L69">终场之时 你方可告诉我</text><text for="L70">是否为狂热瞬间 痛苦也值得</text><text for="L71">我有一连串前欢旧爱</text><text for="L72">他们指认我是个疯子</text><text for="L73">因为你知道我就爱花花公子</text><text for="L74">恰好你也痴迷这场爱情游戏</text><text for="L75">正因为我们年轻无畏</text><text for="L76">才会把路走得这么远</text><text for="L77">可结局只会让你喘不过气</text><text for="L78">甚者是留下严重伤疤</text><text for="L79">我有一连串前欢旧爱</text><text for="L80">他们指认我是个疯子</text><text for="L81">但我还预留了个空位 宝贝</text><text for="L82">当然也会写下你的名字</text></translation></translations></iTunesMetadata></metadata></head><body><div itunes:song-part="Intro"><p begin="0:05.800" end="0:08.380" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:05.800" end="0:06.130">Nice</span> <span begin="0:06.130" end="0:06.430">to</span>  <span begin="0:06.460" end="0:06.730">meet</span> <span begin="0:06.730" end="0:07.030">you</span><span begin="0:07.030" end="0:07.120">,</span> <span begin="0:07.120" end="0:07.390">where</span> <span begin="0:07.390" end="0:07.630">you</span> <span begin="0:07.630" end="0:08.380">been</span><span begin="0:08.380" end="0:08.380">?</span></p><p begin="0:08.380" end="0:10.840" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:08.380" end="0:08.560">I</span> <span begin="0:08.560" end="0:08.800">could</span> <span begin="0:08.800" end="0:09.220">show</span> <span begin="0:09.220" end="0:09.490">you</span> <span begin="0:09.490" end="0:10.240">incredible</span> <span begin="0:10.240" end="0:10.780">things</span></p><p begin="0:10.840" end="0:13.330" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:10.840" end="0:11.410">Magic</span><span begin="0:11.410" end="0:11.440">,</span> <span begin="0:11.440" end="0:12.040">madness</span><span begin="0:12.040" end="0:12.070">,</span> <span begin="0:12.070" end="0:12.610">heaven</span><span begin="0:12.610" end="0:12.670">,</span> <span begin="0:12.670" end="0:13.330">sin</span></p><p begin="0:13.330" end="0:15.100" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:13.330" end="0:13.600">Saw</span> <span begin="0:13.600" end="0:13.840">you</span> <span begin="0:13.840" end="0:14.260">there</span><span begin="0:14.260" end="0:14.320">,</span> <span begin="0:14.320" end="0:14.590">and</span> <span begin="0:14.590" end="0:14.740">I</span> <span begin="0:14.740" end="0:15.100">thought</span></p><p begin="0:15.100" end="0:17.740" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:15.100" end="0:15.280">"</span><span begin="0:15.280" end="0:15.490">Oh</span> <span begin="0:15.490" end="0:15.850">my</span> <span begin="0:15.850" end="0:16.360">God</span><span begin="0:16.360" end="0:16.480">,</span> <span begin="0:16.480" end="0:16.750">look</span> <span begin="0:16.750" end="0:16.840">at</span> <span begin="0:16.840" end="0:17.140">that</span> <span begin="0:17.140" end="0:17.680">face</span></p><p begin="0:17.740" end="0:20.230" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:17.740" end="0:18.070">You</span> <span begin="0:18.070" end="0:18.430">look</span> <span begin="0:18.430" end="0:18.880">like</span> <span begin="0:18.880" end="0:19.060">my</span> <span begin="0:19.060" end="0:19.330">next</span> <span begin="0:19.330" end="0:20.140">mistake</span></p><p begin="0:20.230" end="0:25.540" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:20.230" end="0:20.680">Love's</span> <span begin="0:20.680" end="0:20.860">a</span> <span begin="0:20.860" end="0:21.310">game</span><span begin="0:21.310" end="0:21.430">,</span> <span begin="0:21.430" end="0:21.910">wanna</span> <span begin="0:21.910" end="0:25.540">play</span><span begin="0:25.540" end="0:25.540">?</span><span begin="0:25.540" end="0:25.540">"</span></p></div><div itunes:song-part="PreChorus"><p begin="0:25.540" end="0:28.330" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:25.540" end="0:25.570">Aye</span><span begin="0:25.570" end="0:25.780">,</span> <span begin="0:25.780" end="0:26.410">new</span>  <span begin="0:26.440" end="0:26.980">money</span><span begin="0:26.980" end="0:27.040">,</span> <span begin="0:27.040" end="0:27.400">suit</span> <span begin="0:27.400" end="0:27.730">and</span> <span begin="0:27.730" end="0:28.330">tie</span></p><p begin="0:28.330" end="0:30.910" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:28.330" end="0:28.570">I</span> <span begin="0:28.570" end="0:28.870">can</span> <span begin="0:28.870" end="0:29.200">read</span> <span begin="0:29.200" end="0:29.320">you</span> <span begin="0:29.320" end="0:29.560">like</span> <span begin="0:29.560" end="0:29.620">a</span> <span begin="0:29.620" end="0:30.730">magazine</span></p><p begin="0:30.910" end="0:33.460" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:30.910" end="0:31.180">Ain't</span> <span begin="0:31.180" end="0:31.450">it</span>  <span begin="0:31.480" end="0:31.990">funny</span><span begin="0:31.990" end="0:32.170">,</span> <span begin="0:32.170" end="0:32.710">rumors</span> <span begin="0:32.710" end="0:33.430">fly</span></p><p begin="0:33.460" end="0:35.500" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:33.460" end="0:33.670">And</span> <span begin="0:33.670" end="0:33.820">I</span> <span begin="0:33.820" end="0:34.150">know</span>  <span begin="0:34.180" end="0:34.450">you</span> <span begin="0:34.450" end="0:34.870">heard</span> <span begin="0:34.870" end="0:35.260">about</span> <span begin="0:35.260" end="0:35.500">me</span></p><p begin="0:35.500" end="0:37.630" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:35.500" end="0:35.920">So</span> <span begin="0:35.920" end="0:36.310">hey</span><span begin="0:36.310" end="0:36.490">,</span> <span begin="0:36.490" end="0:36.820">let's</span> <span begin="0:36.820" end="0:37.090">be</span> <span begin="0:37.090" end="0:37.570">friends</span></p><p begin="0:37.630" end="0:40.240" itunes:key="L13" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:37.630" end="0:37.780">I'm</span> <span begin="0:37.780" end="0:38.140">dyin'</span> <span begin="0:38.140" end="0:38.290">to</span> <span begin="0:38.290" end="0:38.710">see</span>  <span begin="0:38.740" end="0:39.010">how</span> <span begin="0:39.010" end="0:39.310">this</span> <span begin="0:39.310" end="0:39.670">one</span> <span begin="0:39.670" end="0:40.150">ends</span></p><p begin="0:40.240" end="0:42.790" itunes:key="L14" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:40.240" end="0:40.600">Grab</span> <span begin="0:40.600" end="0:40.720">your</span> <span begin="0:40.720" end="0:41.380">passport</span>  <span begin="0:41.530" end="0:41.800">and</span> <span begin="0:41.800" end="0:42.160">my</span> <span begin="0:42.160" end="0:42.730">hand</span></p><p begin="0:42.790" end="0:45.460" itunes:key="L15" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:42.790" end="0:42.910">I</span> <span begin="0:42.910" end="0:43.090">can</span> <span begin="0:43.090" end="0:43.270">make</span> <span begin="0:43.270" end="0:43.360">the</span> <span begin="0:43.360" end="0:43.690">bad</span> <span begin="0:43.690" end="0:44.020">guys</span> <span begin="0:44.020" end="0:44.350">good</span> <span begin="0:44.350" end="0:44.560">for</span> <span begin="0:44.560" end="0:44.650">a</span> <span begin="0:44.650" end="0:45.370">weekend</span></p></div><div itunes:song-part="Bridge"><p begin="0:45.460" end="0:48.040" itunes:key="L16" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:45.460" end="0:45.760">So</span> <span begin="0:45.760" end="0:45.940">it's</span> <span begin="0:45.940" end="0:46.180">gonna</span> <span begin="0:46.180" end="0:46.330">be</span> <span begin="0:46.330" end="0:47.800">forever</span></p><p begin="0:48.040" end="0:50.560" itunes:key="L17" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:48.040" end="0:48.280">Or</span> <span begin="0:48.280" end="0:48.430">it's</span> <span begin="0:48.430" end="0:48.700">gonna</span> <span begin="0:48.700" end="0:48.940">go</span> <span begin="0:48.940" end="0:49.420">down</span> <span begin="0:49.420" end="0:49.600">in</span> <span begin="0:49.600" end="0:50.530">flames</span></p><p begin="0:50.560" end="0:53.050" itunes:key="L18" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:50.560" end="0:50.710">You</span> <span begin="0:50.710" end="0:50.890">can</span>  <span begin="0:50.910" end="0:51.090">tell</span> <span begin="0:51.090" end="0:51.190">me</span> <span begin="0:51.190" end="0:51.400">when</span> <span begin="0:51.400" end="0:51.580">it's</span> <span begin="0:51.580" end="0:52.390">over</span><span begin="0:52.390" end="0:52.480">,</span> <span begin="0:52.480" end="0:52.930">mmm</span></p><p begin="0:53.050" end="0:55.510" itunes:key="L19" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:53.050" end="0:53.230">If</span> <span begin="0:53.230" end="0:53.350">the</span> <span begin="0:53.350" end="0:53.740">high</span> <span begin="0:53.740" end="0:54.040">was</span> <span begin="0:54.040" end="0:54.400">worth</span> <span begin="0:54.400" end="0:54.550">the</span> <span begin="0:54.550" end="0:55.480">pain</span></p></div><div itunes:song-part="Chorus"><p begin="0:55.510" end="0:58.030" itunes:key="L20" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:55.510" end="0:55.810">Got</span> <span begin="0:55.810" end="0:55.900">a</span> <span begin="0:55.900" end="0:56.230">long</span> <span begin="0:56.230" end="0:56.620">list</span> <span begin="0:56.620" end="0:56.890">of</span> <span begin="0:56.890" end="